		(uuid "8650ab72-b337-5a6e-87fa-bc66a7b7baa0")
	)
	(text "sidecar_smd (speculative): espBusBangSidecar with bare ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8R2 modules for U1 (main) and U2 (Sidecar), same nets per GPIO. Each: AMS1117-3.3 from the board rail (+5V, J6 to the PBI 5V), 10u in, 22u out, 100n at the module, EN 10k/1u RC reset, IO0 10k pull-up (boot from flash).\nJ4 Sidecar debug/flash: 1 +5V, 2 GND, 3 BOOT (IO0, low = download), 4 EN, 5 RX (RXD0/GPIO44), 6 TX (TXD0/GPIO43). J5, main debug/flash: same pinout on the main module; its RX/TX are Atari D6/D5, so use it with the Atari off.\nJ6: PBI 5V (VCC50_1) to the board rail (+5V): fit to run from the Atari; remove when powering from J4/J5, so the Atari isn't back-fed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e6e610d9-ea44-5aa5-9cf5-36e88cd27dfe")
	)
